      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2019 gross claims outstanding were $995.162m. The syndicate recorded adverse prior-year reserve development (the report discloses a net deterioration of $11.142m) driven by an accumulation of attritional and large losses across Property (D&F), Aviation, Hull and Cargo and movements in IBNR; the Reinsurance division experienced windstorms Dorian, Faxai and Hagibis which together accounted for $14m. A large Motor Reinsurance-to-Close (RITC) from 1/1/2018 materially increased Motor gross reserves in the prior year. The report does not disclose an aggregate GROSS prior-year movement figure explicitly, only the net deterioration and the detailed reserve triangle and movements by division.",
